  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The creator of the image is mapped onto the woman in the center",
  "description": "The text 'whoever photoshopped this' explicitly refers to the person who created or edited the image. This person is analogically mapped onto the central woman in the image, who is visually depicted as being shocked and surrounded by accusatory pointing hands. The visual metaphor of the woman being targeted by multiple hands represents the act of being blamed or shamed, which is the core of the meme's message. The woman's shocked expression and the surrounding pointing hands symbolize the public shaming and accusation directed at the creator of the image.",
